{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bump about with Bumper Bout!\u00a0</strong>A competitive pinball party game where two players share the same playfield. Earn points to launch balls to other\u2019s sides and see who can last the longest. Battle across a mix of quirky and colorful arenas each bursting with hazards and surprises. Master every character\u2019s unique Super Ball, a game changing power move that can turn the match in an instant. With solo challenges, local and online multiplayer, and huge replayability, <i>Bumper Bout</i> is easy to pick up and hard to put down and the perfect recipe for laughs, rivalry, and arcade fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938260?t=1760971386","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938260/ce9562ead17290651987acd13520c7c96612bb00/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760971386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938260/e9da6a7392a41f4c92f51d7086996149075f58a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760971386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938260/e9da6a7392a41f4c92f51d7086996149075f58a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760971386","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bump about with Bumper Bout!\u00a0</strong>A competitive pinball party game where two players share the same playfield. Earn